@august_2021
title: A minority government and an anti-restriction right
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.august_2021_done = 1;
Q.porozumienie_status =
    "Jarosław Gowin-led opposition circle outside the United Right";
Q.united_right_cohesion = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 55) - 14
);
const rivalGroup = function(id) {
    return (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
        return record.id == id;
    });
};
const porozumienie = rivalGroup("porozumienie");
const porozumienieTransfer = Math.min(
    6,
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0))
);
Q.porozumienie_exit_done = 1;
Q.porozumienie_active = porozumienieTransfer > 0 ? 1 : 0;
Q.porozumienie_seats = porozumienieTransfer;
Q.pis_seats = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0) - porozumienieTransfer
);
Q.government_support_seats = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.government_support_seats) || 0) - porozumienieTransfer
);
Q.other_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.other_seats) || 0) +
    porozumienieTransfer;
if (porozumienie) {
    porozumienie.active = porozumienieTransfer > 0 ? 1 : 0;
    porozumienie.allied = 0;
    porozumienie.legal_status = "independent parliamentary party";
    porozumienie.mp_count = porozumienieTransfer;
    porozumienie.sejm_mps = porozumienieTransfer;
    porozumienie.exclusive_seats = porozumienieTransfer;
    porozumienie.cohesion = 63;
    porozumienie.defection_readiness = 100;
    porozumienie.electoral_outside_option =
        "independent opposition party and parliamentary circle";
}
const porozumienieClub = [
    "gowin", "michalek", "sroka", "wypij", "bukowiec"
];
const continuedPiS = [
    "ociepa", "gut_mostowy", "murdzek", "baszko", "piechowiak",
    "dabrowska_banaszek"
];
for (const person of (Q.rival_person_records || [])) {
    if (porozumienieClub.includes(person.id)) {
        person.party = "porozumienie";
        person.organisation = "porozumienie";
        person.loyalty = "Gowin";
        person.status = "Porozumienie circle MP";
    } else if (continuedPiS.includes(person.id)) {
        person.party = "pis";
        person.organisation = "pis-aligned successor";
        person.loyalty = "continued PiS allegiance";
        person.status = "PiS-club MP";
    }
}
if (!(Q.rival_person_records || []).some(function(person) {
    return person.id == "pawlowska";
})) {
    Q.rival_person_records.push({
        id: "pawlowska", name: "Monika Pawłowska", chamber: "Sejm",
        party: "porozumienie", organisation: "porozumienie",
        loyalty: "Gowin", status: "Porozumienie circle MP"
    });
}
const trustedVaccination =
    (
        Q.vaccination_strategy == "Public-health mobilisation" ||
        Q.vaccination_strategy == "Local access"
    ) &&
    Number(Q.health_capacity) >= 52 &&
    Number(Q.public_trust) >= 45;
const covidDividend = trustedVaccination ? 0.25 : 0.65;
Q.covid_anti_system_pressure =
    (Number(Q.covid_anti_system_pressure) || 0) +
    (trustedVaccination ? 2 : 5);
Q.konf_org_resources =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_org_resources) || 0) + 2;
Q.konf_poll_momentum =
    (Number(Q.konf_poll_momentum) || 0) + covidDividend;
Q.anti_establishment_youth_konf_affinity =
    (Number(Q.anti_establishment_youth_konf_affinity) || 0) +
    (trustedVaccination ? 1 : 2);
Q.far_right_agenda += trustedVaccination ? 1 : 3;
Q.news_headline =
    "Gowin leaves government as Konfederacja recruits from pandemic anger";
!}

= August 2021 — The governing majority frays

Prime Minister Morawiecki dismisses **Jarosław Gowin** and Gowin's Agreement
party leaves the United Right. The remaining camp is commanded by **Jarosław
Kaczyński**, with Morawiecki's government now dependent on discipline,
defectors and bill-by-bill majorities.

**Outgoing → incoming:** Gowin, deputy premier and internal coalition veto →
Gowin, leader of an opposition parliamentary circle; Kaczyński remains leader
of a smaller governing camp.
**Supporting bloc:** Porozumienie's market liberals and institutional
conservatives reject important Polish Deal tax provisions after their earlier
rebellion over the postal election. Six MPs form a real Porozumienie circle;
former party colleagues who stay with PiS do not follow automatically.
**Why now:** Gowin's dismissal turns a long programme dispute into formal exit.

For Lewica, a minority PiS cabinet creates real leverage on social bills and a
possible no-confidence count, but every selective deal can again be framed as
rescuing the government. At the same time, Konfederacja recruits from
anti-restriction anger.

- @aug21_constructive
- @aug21_health
- @aug21_majority
- @aug21_workers
- @aug21_liberty

@aug21_constructive
title: Force a constructive vote of no confidence
subtitle: Article 158 is available under any President, but a named successor still needs 231 deputies.
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const storedLeftCommitted = Number(Q.left_committed_seats);
const leftCommitted = Math.max(0, Math.round(
    Number.isFinite(storedLeftCommitted)
        ? storedLeftCommitted
        : (Number(Q.left_seats) || 0)
));
const democraticBase =
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0)) +
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0)) +
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0)) +
    leftCommitted;
const porozumienieSupport = Math.min(
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.other_seats) || 0)),
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.porozumienie_seats) || 0))
);
Q.aug21_vonc_left_can_sponsor = leftCommitted >= 46 ? 1 : 0;
Q.aug21_vonc_left_sponsors = leftCommitted;
Q.aug21_vonc_left_votes = leftCommitted;
Q.aug21_vonc_democratic_base = democraticBase;
Q.aug21_vonc_porozumienie_support = porozumienieSupport;
Q.aug21_vonc_other_support = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.other_seats) || 0) - porozumienieSupport
);
const konfSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0));
Q.aug21_vonc_konf_support = Math.min(
    konfSeats,
    Math.max(
        0,
        Math.round(konfSeats * 0.25) +
            (Number(Q.far_right_agenda) >= 60 ? 1 : 0)
    )
);
Q.aug21_technical_cabinet = 0;
!}

= Article 158 — dismissal requires a successor

President **[+ president_name +]** cannot file, vote on or order a Sejm
motion. Under Article 158 the Palace must appoint a successor only if at least
46 deputies sponsor one named candidate and 231 deputies actually elect that
person.

The democratic clubs and Porozumienie currently declare **[+
aug21_vonc_democratic_base +] + [+ aug21_vonc_porozumienie_support +] + [+
aug21_vonc_other_support +]** votes. Konfederacja's **[+
aug21_vonc_konf_support +]** potentially available deputies are a bounded
free-vote estimate, not the whole caucus assigned to a PSL prime minister.

[? if aug21_vonc_left_can_sponsor: Lewica still controls the 46 signatures
needed to force its own motion.?]
[? if not aug21_vonc_left_can_sponsor: Lewica's divided parliamentary family
cannot supply 46 signatures. KO will file the motion instead.?]

